                    '| 2025 | 2025‑12‑31 | [$2,000M](https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1/000000000126000010/0000000001-26-000010-index.htm) | [$240M](https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1/000000000126000010/0000000001-26-000010-index.htm) | [$40M](https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1/000000000126000010/0000000001-26-000010-index.htm) | [$240M](https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1/000000000126000010/0000000001-26-000010-index.htm) | $200M | -$40M | -2.0% | n/a | n/a |  |', \
                    '| **12 months** | 2026‑09‑30 | $2,150M | $258M | $43M | $258M | $215M | -$43M | -2.0% |  |  | quarterly filings: [1](https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1/000000000126000030/0000000001-26-000030-index.htm), [2](https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1/000000000125000030/0000000001-25-000030-index.htm) |' \
                ], \
