                '', \
                'From fiscal 2019 to 2025, Thin Co reported $10.2 billion of revenue and $254 million of free cash flow. Stock pay was $193 million, which leaves $61 million of owner cash: 0.6% of revenue. Owner cash was under 3.0% of revenue in 7 of 7 years. In the 12 months to 2026-09-30 it was 0.6% of revenue.' \
