                    '|  | [Capital & Sons \\[Holdings\\]](#var.vCik=2&var.vPage=\'company\'&_top) |  | n/a | 18.6 | 16.7 | n/a | 32.6 (3) | -2.0% | -2.0% | 12.0% | n/a | n/a | 2019‑2025 | C I |', \
