                '- The latest fiscal year stands in for the latest 12 months: 2', \
                '', \
                '## Operating costs', \
                '', \
                'Of the 5 companies, over the latest five fiscal years:', \
                '', \
                '- Flat or rising costs as a share of revenue (full P2b): 3', \
                '- Costs cut by 10 points of revenue or more (P2b of zero): 0', \
                '- No usable cost line (unranked): 1' \
            ] \
        ], \
        [ \
            'markdownPrint', \
            [ \
                '', \
                '---', \
                '', \
                'Data as of 2026-11-05, from SEC filings. Method version 1.0.0.', \
                'History starts about 2009, when the SEC began collecting financial statements as data.', \
                '', \
                'The index ranks how outside owners have been treated. It is not a short list, a price forecast or investment advice,', \
                'and it makes no finding about any one company\'s intent.' \
            ] \
        ] \
    ])
endfunction
unittestRunTest('testMain_totals')


