                '[Index](#var=&_top) | [Group totals](#var.vPage=\'totals\'&_top) | [Threshold explorer](#var.vPage=\'explore\'&_top) | [Methodology](#var.vPage=\'method\'&_top) | [Data and limits](#var.vPage=\'data\'&_top) | Downloads' \
